"""Relation-only E7 complete-step comparison.

This runner deliberately excludes the recurrent latent transition because the
current Python/native transition parameter layout has an unresolved contract
mismatch. It invokes the experiment-local scan or ordered-postings C ABI on
every measured training step; C ABI synchronization, D2H materialization, and
host-to-device workset creation are inside the measured region.

GPU execution is authorized only by an external Device Scheduler JobSpec and
receipt. The environment marker and run key are accidental-launch guards and
correlation metadata, not resource authority or proof of isolation.
"""
